# brain-corp

Work from the workspace root and use `config/system-map.json` as the source of truth for sidecars.

- Analyst role: `.agents/prompts/analyst.md`
- Tickets: `.agents/tickets/<state>/TICK-XXX-<slug>.md`
- Native SDD: `.brain/features/<ticket>/`
- Central constitution: `.brain/memory/constitution.md`
- Commands: `/cross-analyze`, `/init-work`, `/specify`, `/plan`, `/tasks`, `/implement`, `/analyze`, `/sanity`, `/sync`

Do not implement product code from the root. Every change requires a ticket and traceability.
